<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-09-13T19:34:33+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Sun, 13 Sep 2026 19:34:33 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[90-year-old iconic Twin Chimneys motel in Cheyenne torn down for a coffee drive-thru]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134199099.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Twin Chimneys Motor Court in Cheyenne, Wyoming, was demolished this week after almost 90 years. Its distinctive twin stone chimneys, a landmark along the historic Lincoln Highway, fell in about 30 seconds. The site will now make way for a 7 Brew Coffee drive-thru stand, ending the story of the once-popular motor court.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/cheyennes-twin-chimneys-motor-court-stood-for-almost-90-years-this-week-its-landmark-chimneys-fell-in-about-30-seconds-to-make-way-for-a-drive-thru-coffee-shop/articleshow/134199099.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/cheyennes-twin-chimneys-motor-court-stood-for-almost-90-years-this-week-its-landmark-chimneys-fell-in-about-30-seconds-to-make-way-for-a-drive-thru-coffee-shop/articleshow/134199099.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T19:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134200033,imgsize-201826.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1876, Los Angeles built the Perry House; 99 years later it was moved to Heritage Square]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134197140.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Los Angeles' historic Perry Mansion celebrated its 150th anniversary by opening its second floor. This rare access allowed visitors to see preserved 19th-century rooms and raise funds. The grand Victorian residence was built in 1876 for businessman William Hayes Perry. Preservationists saved the mansion from demolition in 1975 and moved it to Heritage Square Museum. Funds raised will support ongoing structural conservation and protection of the historic wooden building.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1876-los-angeles-built-the-perry-house-99-years-later-it-was-moved-to-heritage-square-for-preservation-and-at-150-its-normally-closed-second-floor-opened-to-visitors/articleshow/134197140.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1876-los-angeles-built-the-perry-house-99-years-later-it-was-moved-to-heritage-square-for-preservation-and-at-150-its-normally-closed-second-floor-opened-to-visitors/articleshow/134197140.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T18:49:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static