100-chickens-and-11-pheasants-after-she-added-13-chickens-and-a-silver-pheasant/articleshow/134190837.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T14:54:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134191019,imgsize-133564.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Donated 100 acre Texas ranch becomes $145mn Odessa complex]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134190717.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Texas family's generous land gift is becoming a major sports and recreation complex. This $145 million project will serve as a neighborhood hub and tournament destination. Construction is progressing towards a significant milestone with a topping-out ceremony next month. The expansive facility will feature numerous indoor courts and outdoor fields for various sports. This new complex promises to draw visitors and boost local economic growth.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2023-a-texas-family-donated-100-acres-of-ranch-land-to-odessa-3-years-later-a-145-million-sports-complex-with-30-indoor-courts-and-22-outdoor-fields-is-taking-shape/articleshow/134190717.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2023-a-texas-family-donated-100-acres-of-ranch-land-to-odessa-3-years-later-a-145-million-sports-complex-with-30-indoor-courts-and-22-outdoor-fields-is-taking-shape/articleshow/134190717.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T14:49:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134190941,imgsize-609425.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin father dies after being struck by truck in Australia, weeks after daughter's birth]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134190718.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-origin-father-dies-after-being-struck-by-truck-in-australia-weeks-after-daughters-birth/articleshow/134190718.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-origin-father-dies-after-being-struck-by-truck-in-australia-weeks-after-daughters-birth/articleshow/134190718.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T14:49:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134190997,imgsize-931861.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Fresh attacks on Strait of Hormuz shipping fuel fears over oil supplies]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134188805.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[During its passage through the Strait of Hormuz, a ship was hit by a projectile, raising alarms about the stability of global energy supplies following a prior drone attack. In response, Saudi Arabia has temporarily closed its crucial East-West oil pipeline as a safety measure. The escalating conflict in the Middle East poses a risk of increased energy prices, with further updates on the situation anticipated shortly.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/fresh-attacks-on-strait-of-hormuz-shipping-fuel-fears-over-oil-supplies/articleshow/134188805.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/fresh-attacks-on-strait-of-hormuz-shipping-fuel-fears-over-oil-supplies/articleshow/134188805.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T14:23:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134188805,imgsize-82760.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Beijing tightens drone crackdown, bans possession, storage across city from Nov 15]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134189640.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[As of November 15, Beijing will officially prohibit residents and businesses from owning drones. Existing drone owners must either sell their devices or dispose of them before the deadline. Infringers will face potential confiscation of their drones along with hefty fines. This regulation enhances security measures, significantly restricting drone operations within the city, following previous limitations on unauthorized flights and the classification of all airspace as restricted.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/beijing-tightens-drone-crackdown-bans-possession-and-storage-across-city-from-november-15/articleshow/134189640.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/beijing-tightens-drone-crackdown-bans-possession-and-storage-across-city-from-november-15/articleshow/134189640.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T14:25:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134189640,imgsize-124038.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ukraine deploys drone specialists to Africa, Middle East to target Russian interests: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134188878.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/ukraine-deploys-drone-specialists-to-africa-middle-east-to-target-russian-interests-report/articleshow/134188878.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/ukraine-deploys-drone-specialists-to-africa-middle-east-to-target-russian-interests-report/articleshow/134188878.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T14:19:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134189552,imgsize-12564.cms"/></item></channel></rss>